
==============================================================================
A. Żądanie autoryzacyjne (przeglądarka -> serwer autoryzacyjny)
==============================================================================
GET http://localhost:8080/realms/pbksi/protocol/openid-connect/auth?response_type=code&client_id=pbksi-webapp&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A5000%2Fcallback&scope=openid+profile+email+roles&state=6cJQ_dqXwzlNXzzkcNTcZA&code_challenge=WpReQ9XjDU_xT9yxUzslPw5KMLAAheCOSXN9iA5KR04&code_challenge_method=S256
HTTP 200 -> strona logowania Keycloaka (8745 B HTML)

==============================================================================
B. Uwierzytelnienie właściciela zasobu (jan) i zgoda na zakres
==============================================================================
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/pbksi/login-actions/authenticate?...  username=jan&password=***
HTTP 302 -> http://localhost:8080/realms/pbksi/login-actions/required-action (wymagana akcja OAUTH_GRANT = zgoda)
HTTP 200 -> ekran zgody, aplikacja prosi o: Profil użytkownika, Adres e-mail, Role użytkownika
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/pbksi/login-actions/consent?...  accept=Yes

==============================================================================
C. Przekierowanie z kodem autoryzacyjnym (serwer autoryzacyjny -> przeglądarka -> klient)
==============================================================================
HTTP 302 Found
Location: http://localhost:5000/callback?state=6cJQ_dqXwzlNXzzkcNTcZA&session_state=3b2eab3e-086c-7950-6424-ce4ff7406712&iss=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A8080%2Frealms%2Fpbks...
Cache-Control: no-store, must-revalidate, max-age=0

state zgodny z wysłanym: True
code = fea8d270-26b7-01d2-d...affa7915

==============================================================================
D. Wymiana kodu na token (klient -> punkt tokenów, back-channel)
==============================================================================
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/pbksi/protocol/openid-connect/token
Authorization: Basic base64(pbksi-webapp:***)
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&code=fea8d270-26b7-01d2-d...affa7915&redirect_uri=http://localhost:5000/callback&code_verifier=czkO_JMTjlnx...

==============================================================================
E. Odpowiedź serwera autoryzacyjnego z tokenami
==============================================================================
HTTP 200 OK
Cache-Control: no-store
Pragma: no-cache
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...glHJU8dA",
  "expires_in": 120,
  "refresh_expires_in": 21600,
  "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIs...85uOWJHQ",
  "token_type": "Bearer",
  "id_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...EJiYcKOQ",
  "not-before-policy": 0,
  "session_state": "3b2eab3e-086c-7950-6424-ce4ff7406712",
  "scope": "openid profile email"
}

access_token : iat=10:21:10 exp=10:23:10 -> czas życia 120 s
refresh_token: iat=10:21:10 exp=16:21:10 -> czas życia 21600 s  (= 6 h)
access_token: realm_access.roles = ['user'], aud = pbksi-api

==============================================================================
Ponowne użycie tego samego kodu autoryzacyjnego (kod jest jednorazowy)
==============================================================================
HTTP 400 Bad Request
Cache-Control: no-store
Pragma: no-cache
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": "invalid_grant",
  "error_description": "Code not valid"
}

==============================================================================
PKCE: przechwycony kod bez właściwego code_verifier jest bezużyteczny
==============================================================================
nowy kod (sesja SSO już istnieje, logowanie nie jest potrzebne): 7865bde6-b96a-2977-f...affa7915
POST /token ... code=<nowy kod>&code_verifier=<inny, losowy>
HTTP 400 Bad Request
Cache-Control: no-store
Pragma: no-cache
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": "invalid_grant",
  "error_description": "PKCE verification failed: Code mismatch"
}

POST /token ... poprawny code i code_verifier, ale zły client_secret
HTTP 401 Unauthorized
Cache-Control: no-store
Pragma: no-cache
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": "unauthorized_client",
  "error_description": "Invalid client or Invalid client credentials"
}

