GET http://localhost:5001/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...glHJU8dA
HTTP 403 FORBIDDEN
WWW-Authenticate: Bearer realm="pbksi-api", error="insufficient_scope", error_description="Permission users:read required", scope="users:read"
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": "insufficient_scope",
  "error_description": "Permission users:read required"
}

==============================================================================
Żądanie bez tokenu i z podrobionym tokenem
==============================================================================

GET http://localhost:5001/api/me
Authorization: Bearer -   (bez nagłówka Authorization)
HTTP 401 UNAUTHORIZED
WWW-Authenticate: Bearer realm="pbksi-api"
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": "unauthorized",
  "error_description": null
}

GET http://localhost:5001/api/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...AAAAAAAA   (token ze zmienionym podpisem)
HTTP 401 UNAUTHORIZED
WWW-Authenticate: Bearer realm="pbksi-api", error="invalid_token", error_description="The access token is invalid"
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": "invalid_token",
  "error_description": "The access token is invalid"
}

==============================================================================
Odświeżenie access tokenu (grant_type=refresh_token)
==============================================================================
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/pbksi/protocol/openid-connect/token
Authorization: Basic base64(pbksi-webapp:***)

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIs...85uOWJHQ
HTTP 200 OK
Cache-Control: no-store
Pragma: no-cache
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...Qwgv_ENg",
  "expires_in": 120,
  "refresh_expires_in": 21598,
  "refresh_token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIs...vmJoLCJQ",
  "token_type": "Bearer",
  "id_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...Moz-gdWQ",
  "not-before-policy": 0,
  "session_state": "3b2eab3e-086c-7950-6424-ce4ff7406712",
  "scope": "openid profile email"
}

nowy refresh_token różny od starego: True
nowy refresh_token: iat=10:21:12 exp=16:21:10 -> czas życia 21598 s
  -> exp się nie przesuwa: refresh token żyje maks. 6 h od zalogowania (ssoSessionMaxLifespan)
introspekcja nowego access tokenu: active = True

==============================================================================
Ponowne użycie STAREGO refresh tokenu (rotacja: revokeRefreshToken=true, refreshTokenMaxReuse=0)
==============================================================================
HTTP 400 Bad Request
Cache-Control: no-store
Pragma: no-cache
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": "invalid_grant",
  "error_description": "Maximum allowed refresh token reuse exceeded"
}

introspekcja NOWEGO access tokenu po tej próbie: active = False
  -> wykrycie ponownego użycia unieważnia całą sesję (całą "rodzinę" tokenów),
     więc złodziej starego refresh tokenu nie zyskuje nic, a prawowity klient musi się zalogować ponownie

GET http://localhost:5001/api/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...Qwgv_ENg   (nowy access token po wykryciu ponownego użycia)
HTTP 401 UNAUTHORIZED
WWW-Authenticate: Bearer realm="pbksi-api", error="invalid_token", error_description="The access token has been revoked"
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": "invalid_token",
  "error_description": "The access token has been revoked"
}

==============================================================================
Nowe logowanie (bez wypisywania kroków) i unieważnienie tokenów jak przy wylogowaniu
==============================================================================
nowe tokeny: access eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...MPLIfnvQ, refresh eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIs...yLDl8hcQ
introspekcja access tokenu: active = True
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/pbksi/protocol/openid-connect/revoke  token_type_hint=refresh_token -> HTTP 200
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/pbksi/protocol/openid-connect/revoke  token_type_hint=access_token -> HTTP 200
introspekcja access tokenu po revoke: active = False

GET http://localhost:5001/api/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...MPLIfnvQ   (unieważniony access token)
HTTP 401 UNAUTHORIZED
WWW-Authenticate: Bearer realm="pbksi-api", error="invalid_token", error_description="The access token has been revoked"
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": "invalid_token",
  "error_description": "The access token has been revoked"
}

POST /token grant_type=refresh_token (unieważniony refresh token)
HTTP 400 Bad Request
Cache-Control: no-store
Pragma: no-cache
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "error": "invalid_grant",
  "error_description": "Session not active"
}
